1
00:00:06,220 --> 00:00:07,840
Do you enjoy life?

2
00:00:09,060 --> 00:00:11,880
Do your parents always ask you to do housework?

3
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:15,460
Does your teacher give you homework every day?

4
00:00:16,730 --> 00:00:21,190
Life is sometimes difficult because there are lots of things to do.

5
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:27,670
It's great to be busy, but it's important to look after yourself and have fun, too.

6
00:00:28,530 --> 00:00:36,830
We all need to think about ourselves and do things we like, whether it is playing an instrument or taking photos.

7
00:00:36,830 --> 00:00:42,170
But we also need to do things that keep us healthy and happy.

8
00:00:43,890 --> 00:00:44,630
Here's our quiz.

9
00:00:45,430 --> 00:00:50,370
Try it and find out: do you have lots of fun?

10
00:00:54,040 --> 00:00:55,360
Do you laugh a lot?

11
00:00:57,170 --> 00:00:59,110
Yes, I laugh all the time.

12
00:01:01,160 --> 00:01:02,840
I only laugh when I'm happy.

13
00:01:05,060 --> 00:01:08,260
My best friend says I don't laugh very often.

14
00:01:11,820 --> 00:01:13,620
How many hobbies do you have?

15
00:01:15,320 --> 00:01:16,760
I have lots of hobbies.

16
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:18,980
One.

17
00:01:21,230 --> 00:01:22,530
I don't have any hobbies.

18
00:01:26,420 --> 00:01:27,880
When do you listen to music?

19
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:32,560
In the morning, afternoon and evening.

20
00:01:34,860 --> 00:01:37,240
I only listen to music when I have time.

21
00:01:39,430 --> 00:01:41,050
I never listen to music.

22
00:01:41,430 --> 00:01:42,630
I don't have time.

23
00:01:46,270 --> 00:01:48,720
How many hours do you sleep a night?

24
00:01:50,900 --> 00:01:52,700
9-10 hours.

25
00:01:55,320 --> 00:01:56,180
About 8 hours.

26
00:01:58,310 --> 00:01:59,590
Less than 8 hours.

27
00:02:03,420 --> 00:02:04,880
Do you like doing exercise?

28
00:02:07,140 --> 00:02:09,080
Yes, exercise is fun.

29
00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:14,700
Some exercise is OK, but not everything.

30
00:02:17,260 --> 00:02:19,380
I don't like exercise at all.

31
00:02:23,110 --> 00:02:25,750
Do you like word and number puzzles?

32
00:02:27,740 --> 00:02:28,960
I like puzzles a lot.

33
00:02:31,250 --> 00:02:35,470
Word puzzles are OK, but number puzzles are boring.

34
00:02:37,730 --> 00:02:40,290
No, I don't like puzzles at all.

35
00:02:43,990 --> 00:02:46,650
Which of these activities do you do most?

36
00:02:49,260 --> 00:02:51,180
Spend time with friends and family.

37
00:02:53,250 --> 00:02:55,720
Message friends online or on my phone.

38
00:02:57,795 --> 00:03:00,744
Watch TV or play games on my phone.

39
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:03,660
Your score.

40
00:03:05,340 --> 00:03:10,620
Mostly As: Wow! You know how to have fun and enjoy life.

41
00:03:11,900 --> 00:03:20,110
Mostly Bs: Hmm, OK, but can you do more? Try and find more time for yourself.

42
00:03:22,100 --> 00:03:27,530
Mostly Cs: Try and find more ways to have more fun.
